{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.jonesMarkov_weights_are_molien","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.jonesMarkov_weights_are_molien","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L155-L163","doc":"**(CAPSTONE) The whole `S₃` Jones–Markov weight system is Webster–Williamson\nMolien series** at the single forced specialisation `u = q²`, `t = qz/(q²−qz−1)`,\nwith one common perfect-square normaliser `(q²−qz−1)²`. Resolves the Molien\nlead's items 4 / 2 and the weight-level half of item 1 for `n = 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.yStd_eq_molien","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.yStd_eq_molien","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L149-L153","doc":"**`y_(2,1) = M_std · Z`**, cleared:\n`yStdNum · molStdDen(q²) = yStdDen · N_(2,1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.ySign_eq_molien","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.ySign_eq_molien","kind":"theorem","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L143-L147","doc":"**`y_(1³) = M_sign · Z`**, cleared:\n`ySignNum · molOneDimDen(q²) = yOneDimDen · N_(1³)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.yThree_eq_molien","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.yThree_eq_molien","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L137-L141","doc":"**`y_(3) = M_triv · Z`**, cleared:\n`yThreeNum · molOneDimDen(q²) = yOneDimDen · N_(3)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nStd_is_molien","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nStd_is_molien","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L127-L133","doc":"`N_(2,1) = molStdNum(q², qz/W)·W²` (cleared). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nSign_is_molien","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nSign_is_molien","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L119-L125","doc":"`N_(1³) = molSignNum(q², qz/W)·W²` (cleared). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nThree_is_molien","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nThree_is_molien","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L111-L117","doc":"`N_(3) = molTrivNum(q², qz/W)·W²` with `W = q²−qz−1` (cleared). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.molStdNum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.molStdNum","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L102-L103","doc":"Molien numerator of the standard rep `V_(2,1)`: `t²u + tu² + t + u`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.molSignNum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.molSignNum","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L100-L101","doc":"Molien numerator of the sign rep `V_(1³)`: `t² + tu² + tu + u³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.molTrivNum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.molTrivNum","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L98-L99","doc":"Molien numerator of the trivial rep `V_(3)`: `t²u³ + tu² + tu + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nStd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nStd","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L91-L94","doc":"`N_(2,1)` — the standard-rep Molien numerator, specialised and denom-cleared. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nSign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nSign","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L87-L90","doc":"`N_(1³)` — the sign-rep Molien numerator, specialised and denom-cleared. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nThree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.nThree","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L83-L86","doc":"`N_(3)` — the trivial-rep Molien numerator, specialised and denom-cleared. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.molStdDenAtQsq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.molStdDenAtQsq","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L78-L79","doc":"`molStdDen(q²) = (q²)⁴ − (q²)³ − q² + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.molOneDimDenAtQsq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.molOneDimDenAtQsq","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L76-L77","doc":"`molOneDimDen(q²) = (q²)⁵ − (q²)³ − (q²)² + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.yStdDen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.yStdDen","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L71-L72","doc":"`y_(2,1)` denominator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.yOneDimDen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.yOneDimDen","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN3.lean#L69-L70","doc":"Shared `y` denominator for the one-dimensional reps. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.yStdNum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN3.yStdNum","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://git